mapping "s32001.1" source="s32001" target="SNOMED_CT:38199008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s32001 SNOMED CT 38199008 = ICF s3 subdivision: the permanent teeth (secondary dentition).
        The SNOMED CT mirror contains no single body-structure concept (only specific permanent-tooth
        concepts and a finding, which is a finding not a body structure). Best available standard target
        is (Athena 4244368) =, which fully subsumes the permanent subset (every permanent tooth is a
        tooth), so the target is broader. Low tier : the target is the general tooth-structure concept,
        broader than the source's permanent-only framing; SNOMED CT models permanent-vs-deciduous via
        individual tooth concepts rather than a single permanent-dentition concept.
        """
}
